data: {"messages":[{"content":"请测试 `roi-mapping` skill 的 Agent 真链路。\n\n必须严格执行：\n1. 先调用 read_file 读取 `/mnt/skills/custom/roi-mapping/SKILL.md`。\n2. 再调用 bash 执行下面这段命令，不要改路径，不要省略任何输出文件。\n3. 执行完成后读取 `/mnt/user-data/outputs/roi-mapping/result.json`，并在最终回复中返回这个 JSON 的内容和简短结论。\n\n```bash\nmkdir -p /mnt/user-data/outputs/roi-mapping /mnt/user-data/workspace/roi-mapping\npython - <<'PY'\nimport json, pathlib\ntracks = {\"tracks\":[{\"track_id\":\"track_0001\",\"camera_id\":\"CAM_DEERFLOW_001\",\"label\":\"person\",\"last_bbox\":[100,100,180,260],\"confidence\":0.9,\"evidence_frame_ids\":[\"frame_001\"]}]}\np = pathlib.Path('/mnt/user-data/workspace/roi-mapping/tracks.json')\np.parent.mkdir(parents=True, exist_ok=True)\njson.dump(tracks, p.open('w'), ensure_ascii=False, indent=2)\nPY\npython /mnt/skills/custom/roi-mapping/scripts/run.py --tracks-json /mnt/user-data/workspace/roi-mapping/tracks.json --camera-id CAM_DEERFLOW_001 --position-strategy bbox_overlap --config /mnt/skills/custom/configs/deerflow_config.json --output /mnt/user-data/outputs/roi-mapping/result.json\n```\n\n成功判定：必须能看到 read_file 读取该 SKILL.md、bash 执行该 skill 入口、并生成 `/mnt/user-data/outputs/roi-mapping/result.json`。","additional_kwargs":{},"response_metadata":{},"type":"human","name":null,"id":"a72b1379-76cf-431f-8c8e-5b4c23917c3b"}],"viewed_images":{},"artifacts":[]}

